Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.02,0:00:12.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若邪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.98,0:00:14.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,抓个坚实可靠的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.61,0:00:21.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不是让你抓三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.66,0:00:25.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.62,0:00:31.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.54,0:00:32.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,给你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.41,0:00:33.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,别又飞走了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:34.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,谢谢三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.21,0:00:34.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,收
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:36.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哥哥还会此等法术
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.13,0:00:37.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,神奇啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:38.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.67,0:00:39.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要慌
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.60,0:00:47.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.60,0:00:48.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这样比较安全
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.56,0:00:50.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你暂时忍一忍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.98,0:00:52.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.77,0:00:53.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要再抓人了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.94,0:00:57.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,离我远点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.98,0:00:58.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,恶心死了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.28,0:00:59.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,滚开
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.23,0:01:01.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么你们也上来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.15,0:01:03.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,问你这条傻白绫吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.74,0:01:06.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,说了别抓人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.87,0:01:08.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,神官也算人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.92,0:01:18.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们也暂时忍一忍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.67,0:01:19.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若邪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.55,0:01:20.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,千万别再抓错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.80,0:01:22.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.05,0:01:24.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,别指望这玩意儿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.26,0:01:25.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,想点儿别的办法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.64,0:01:33.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,抓住了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.64,0:01:34.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再给它一次机会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.89,0:01:36.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,放过路人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.94,0:01:37.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这次稳了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.77,0:01:38.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那头重得很
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.61,0:01:40.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,收
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.26,0:02:10.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这可真是天官赐福
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.72,0:02:13.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快 进去避避
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.84,0:04:26.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,天杀的那两个
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.35,0:04:27.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要是被我抓到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.10,0:04:28.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我绝对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.89,0:04:29.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,绝对什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.89,0:04:30.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再吞几斤沙子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.31,0:04:32.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.28,0:04:41.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.28,0:04:43.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.70,0:04:46.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那二人步伐轻盈奇异
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.78,0:04:47.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,绝非凡人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.99,0:04:51.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那白衣女子应该就是半月国师
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.04,0:04:53.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那黑衣女子又是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.92,0:04:54.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,难道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.13,0:04:58.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是妖道双师中的芳心国师
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.59,0:04:59.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.92,0:05:01.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,芳心国师是永安国的国师
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.51,0:05:04.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,两人出世时间相隔近百年
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.80,0:05:07.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你怎么这么清楚永安国的事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.85,0:05:08.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.18,0:05:10.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,实不相瞒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.35,0:05:12.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我曾在永安国收过破烂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.35,0:05:15.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,总之
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.65,0:05:18.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若半月国师想要把我们拦在此处
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.36,0:05:19.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,她做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.07,0:05:21.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那咱们就在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.32,0:05:22.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,等风沙过去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.99,0:05:23.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也只能这样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.29,0:05:40.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,对了 南风
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.55,0:05:41.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,刚刚风沙里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.92,0:05:43.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们怎么不使个千斤坠
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.22,0:05:44.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,使了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:45.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没用
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.30,0:05:47.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这里是极西北
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.05,0:05:49.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,方圆数百里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.43,0:05:51.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,根本找不到一间玄真庙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:53.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我家将军管东南
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.23,0:05:55.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他家将军主西南
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.81,0:05:56.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,出了范围
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.94,0:05:57.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,法力受限
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.61,0:06:01.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.94,0:06:02.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这岩石硬得紧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.78,0:06:05.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,为何能挖出这样一个洞来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.66,0:06:10.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,南阳殿的人跟他主子一样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.91,0:06:12.49,Dialog,,0,0,0,,见到什么都大惊小怪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.92,0:06:20.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,半月人以放牧为生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.09,0:06:22.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,过夜时为避风沙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.00,0:06:24.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大多会在岩石上开凿洞穴
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.30,0:06:26.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有时
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.09,0:06:27.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,甚至会用上炸药
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.22,0:06:32.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.60,0:06:34.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,谁在那
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.77,0:06:42.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.11,0:06:48.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我 我们是路过的普通商人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.78,0:06:50.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,外面风沙太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.28,0:06:51.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就在这儿避避风
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.49,0:06:54.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,既是普通商人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.37,0:06:57.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,为何鬼鬼祟祟躲藏于此
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.71,0:06:58.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们好好避着风
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.00,0:07:00.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们忽然闯进来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.21,0:07:01.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,手上还凭空冒火
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.96,0:07:03.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,谁知道你们是人是鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.80,0:07:05.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哪敢出声啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.51,0:07:08.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,臭小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.93,0:07:11.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,天生 别乱说话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.97,0:07:13.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,郑伯 我可没乱说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.56,0:07:15.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,明明他们才可疑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.56,0:07:22.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,误会误会
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.73,0:07:24.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,在下是一间道观的观主
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.61,0:07:25.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这几位
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.44,0:07:26.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都是我观内之人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.03,0:07:27.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他们使的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.24,0:07:29.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,乃是奇门遁甲之术
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.16,0:07:32.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如此说来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.37,0:07:34.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们是普通商人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.74,0:07:36.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们是普通道人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.54,0:07:37.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,为避风沙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.54,0:07:39.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,恰好躲进同一个岩洞
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.04,0:07:41.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.33,0:07:43.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,既然大家都是普通人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.33,0:07:45.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,此处每逢过关 失踪过半
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.75,0:07:46.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,诸位竟还敢来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.59,0:07:48.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如何能说普通
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.51,0:07:52.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,传闻多有夸大之处
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.68,0:07:53.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只要找对人带路
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.14,0:07:55.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不进入半月古国
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.85,0:07:57.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还是能平安往返的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.60,0:07:59.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.60,0:08:01.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们有本地人带路
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.27,0:08:02.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,躲过了好多流沙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.02,0:08:04.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,刚才一起风
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.15,0:08:05.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他就带我们躲进来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.11,0:08:07.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,对吧 阿昭哥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.99,0:08:10.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,职责所在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.24,0:08:12.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,希望这风过了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.70,0:08:13.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,骆驼和货也都没事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.12,0:08:15.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一定没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.20,0:08:18.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所以 道长您看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.24,0:08:19.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,既是一场误会
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.54,0:08:20.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,方才多有得罪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.91,0:08:21.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,抱歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.20,0:08:52.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.70,0:08:54.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.95,0:08:57.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你坐的这块石头上好像有字
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.45,0:08:57.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.21,0:09:11.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.05,0:09:12.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,半月文
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.09,0:09:15.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你会看半月文
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.18,0:09:17.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,实不相瞒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.60,0:09:19.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,半月妖道出世之前
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.31,0:09:20.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也在半月国收过破烂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.56,0:09:23.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就好奇还有哪儿你没去收过破烂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.40,0:09:27.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,别理他
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.56,0:09:28.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,石碑上说了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.03,0:09:35.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,将军
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.28,0:09:36.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.70,0:09:38.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这石碑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.70,0:09:39.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是块将军冢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.54,0:09:41.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.49,0:09:42.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你也会半月文
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.08,0:09:45.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,兴趣使然 认识几个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.08,0:09:46.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.04,0:09:48.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你再过来些
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.00,0:09:48.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们一起看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.47,0:10:02.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,将军
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.14,0:10:05.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这上面讲了一位将军的生平
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.06,0:10:07.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,半月国的将军
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.52,0:10:11.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是位中原的将军
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.48,0:10:14.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,半月和中原战事不断
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.03,0:10:16.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,为何会为中原将军立冢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.86,0:10:19.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,因为此人很是奇特
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.99,0:10:22.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,石碑上虽称他为将军
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.49,0:10:25.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他却只是一名校尉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.63,0:10:30.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,当年半月国和中原战事激烈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.54,0:10:32.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他带兵守在前线
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.63,0:10:36.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那他是后来打了胜仗才升了将军
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.43,0:10:38.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,并没有
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.76,0:10:39.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一开始
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.84,0:10:40.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他统领百人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.51,0:10:43.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,后来 他统领七十人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.39,0:10:46.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再后来 他统领五十人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.68,0:10:47.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一路被贬
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.90,0:10:50.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,官还能越做越低
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.56,0:10:51.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只要不犯错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.65,0:10:52.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就算不升
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.44,0:10:53.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也不会降吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.07,0:10:56.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,天底下真有这么失败的人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.82,0:10:58.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这位小朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.95,0:11:00.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,世界之大 无奇不有
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.24,0:11:02.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们继续
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.66,0:11:05.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这校尉之所以屡次被贬
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.95,0:11:08.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只因他在战场上多番碍事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.00,0:11:08.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什么叫碍事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:10.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,阻拦对方杀害己方百姓
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.50,0:11:12.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也阻拦己方这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.00,0:11:15.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,拦一次就降一级
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.55,0:11:17.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,到最后
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.67,0:11:18.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就贬无可贬了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.68,0:11:21.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,阻拦士兵杀害百姓
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.59,0:11:22.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这是在救人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.80,0:11:23.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,又有什么错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.01,0:11:25.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是啊 又没害人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.56,0:11:26.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,对啊 有什么错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.68,0:11:27.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嘁
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.81,0:11:28.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,错得离谱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.98,0:11:30.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,在其位谋其职
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.02,0:11:32.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这人既是军人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.48,0:11:34.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就该时刻牢记军人的职责
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.98,0:11:36.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,战场上伤亡在所难免
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.11,0:11:38.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他要两边兼顾
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.61,0:11:40.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只会落得己方厌憎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.03,0:11:41.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,敌方嘲笑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.82,0:11:42.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,到头来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.99,0:11:43.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什么都做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.49,0:11:45.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可他真的救了人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.79,0:11:47.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他们还为他立碑了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.50,0:11:48.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有碑在此
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.96,0:11:50.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,证明这校尉不还是死了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.08,0:11:52.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有史记载
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.54,0:11:53.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,半月国不还是没了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.13,0:11:55.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他做的事有用吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.21,0:11:58.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可是 可是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.84,0:11:59.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,小朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.17,0:12:01.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你太天真了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.59,0:12:04.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,道长
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.68,0:12:05.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我说得对么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.39,0:12:08.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可是这个校尉明明在救人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.77,0:12:10.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,说得挺对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.48,0:12:12.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他死了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.81,0:12:14.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,死在自己人手上了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.11,0:12:15.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,倒没有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.27,0:12:17.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,上面说
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.44,0:12:18.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有次两方交战
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.07,0:12:20.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,打着打着
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.57,0:12:21.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这人靴带没系紧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.20,0:12:23.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,自己踩着了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.20,0:12:24.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,摔了一跤
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.53,0:12:25.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.66,0:12:27.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就被双方杀红了眼的士兵
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.95,0:12:30.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,乱脚踩死 乱刀砍死了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.33,0:12:37.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.17,0:12:41.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,很好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.76,0:12:43.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没有没有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.89,0:12:45.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只是这死法有点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.97,0:12:46.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.85,0:12:50.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这校尉虽在军中口碑不佳
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.18,0:12:52.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,却也有人受其恩惠
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:54.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他们尊他为将军
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.44,0:12:56.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,立了这块冢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.52,0:12:59.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,后来人们发现这石碑很是神奇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.49,0:13:02.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只要对它跪拜三次
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.32,0:13:04.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,便可在戈壁逢凶化吉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.24,0:13:05.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.66,0:13:08.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.92,0:13:22.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,石碑上有这句话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.17,0:13:23.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我编的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.72,0:13:25.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他们笑够了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.18,0:13:27.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,拜拜也不为过
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.01,0:13:28.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,调皮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.72,0:13:29.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.47,0:13:31.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有蛇呀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.93,0:13:33.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么会有蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.86,0:13:40.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,沙漠里有蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.11,0:13:42.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,岂非是常事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.57,0:13:43.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,当心它的尾巴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.69,0:13:44.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.11,0:13:47.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这尾巴生得有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.37,0:13:49.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哥哥 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.49,0:13:51.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,果然是蝎尾蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.12,0:13:54.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,蝎尾蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.12,0:13:56.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,半月国的一种生物
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.75,0:13:58.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,身似蛇 尾似蝎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.96,0:13:59.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有剧毒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.09,0:14:02.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那半月妖道能成为国师
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.63,0:14:05.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也归功于她能操纵这种蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.09,0:14:08.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,操纵
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.35,0:14:11.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,蛇不只一条
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.51,0:14:12.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大家快出去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.77,0:14:16.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.27,0:14:16.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.19,0:14:18.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好多蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.23,0:14:20.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这里也有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.57,0:14:29.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.80,0:14:45.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,出去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.67,0:14:47.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.72,0:14:48.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.43,0:14:49.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.47,0:14:49.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.23,0:15:05.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么拜了石碑 反倒遇险
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.19,0:15:05.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.03,0:15:07.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,越拜越倒霉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.11,0:15:08.49,Dialog,,0,0,0,,跟那破烂仙人一样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.03,0:15:11.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.20,0:15:12.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,郑伯伯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.16,0:15:15.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,郑伯伯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.04,0:15:16.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.50,0:15:24.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好厉害的蛇毒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.93,0:15:29.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,做得好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.55,0:15:33.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,阿昭哥
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.76,0:15:35.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,伯伯不会死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.31,0:15:37.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,中蝎尾蛇毒者
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.93,0:15:39.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,两个时辰内必死无疑
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.10,0:15:41.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.52,0:15:45.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这是解药吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.32,0:15:47.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,临时续命的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.69,0:15:48.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,最多拖延十二个时辰
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.49,0:15:55.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,岂不是要等死
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.79,0:15:56.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,真的没救了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.04,0:15:57.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有救
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.66,0:16:00.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有香草名叫善月草
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.67,0:16:01.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可解蝎尾蛇毒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.54,0:16:03.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,阿昭哥
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.71,0:16:05.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有解药你怎么不早说
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.96,0:16:07.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,中毒的人有救
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.46,0:16:08.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,别的人却要死
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.97,0:16:10.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他当然不好说
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.55,0:16:11.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.80,0:16:12.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,善月草
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.22,0:16:14.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只长在半月古国境内
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.55,0:16:16.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,难怪总有人会冒死闯入半月国
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.43,0:16:17.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.10,0:16:19.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.48,0:16:20.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这可如何是好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.64,0:16:21.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.98,0:16:25.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,蝎尾蛇毒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.11,0:16:27.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这就是半月国师的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.53,0:16:28.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,灵文
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.24,0:16:29.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我有事问你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.86,0:16:31.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,灵文
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.07,0:16:35.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们能进通灵阵吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.45,0:16:36.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我进不了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.45,0:16:39.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也不行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.91,0:16:40.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.33,0:16:46.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,连通灵阵都被阻隔了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.42,0:16:48.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这到底
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.72,0:16:53.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.90,0:17:06.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,道长
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.40,0:17:07.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大家留心些
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.52,0:17:08.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,说不定附近还有蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.99,0:17:11.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,道长 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.78,0:17:12.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.95,0:17:16.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们别在意
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.03,0:17:17.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没有那么严重
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.67,0:17:32.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.72,0:17:33.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,忍一忍
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.80,0:17:39.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不必
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.56,0:17:40.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,蝎尾蛇毒厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.72,0:17:41.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你当心中毒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.07,0:17:51.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他本来不一定会被咬
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.78,0:17:52.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你瞎抓什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.19,0:17:54.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,添乱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.57,0:17:56.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可万一他真的受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.37,0:18:01.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好了 三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.83,0:18:02.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我真的不痛了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.50,0:18:10.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.13,0:18:11.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.38,0:18:15.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大家也检查一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.84,0:18:16.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若身上有伤
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.88,0:18:17.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,尽快扎住
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.02,0:18:28.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,道长哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.27,0:18:30.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你的手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.06,0:18:30.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.77,0:18:31.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没事个鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.02,0:18:33.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你都中了蛇毒了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.44,0:18:34.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,最好赶紧回天
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.53,0:18:36.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,回去一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.78,0:18:38.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什么 你们要走
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.57,0:18:39.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那我们怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.95,0:18:40.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,道长
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.45,0:18:41.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们可别丢下我们呐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.12,0:18:45.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如今通灵被阻
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.91,0:18:47.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,确实有必要回去通报
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.00,0:18:49.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,救人要紧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.29,0:18:50.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,别着急
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.21,0:18:52.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们这就进城去找善月草
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.42,0:18:54.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,在十二个时辰之内
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.17,0:18:56.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,把它带给你们
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.30,0:18:56.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.05,0:18:57.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只不过
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.34,0:18:59.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们需要这位小兄弟来带路
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.05,0:19:02.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.76,0:19:04.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们要是没了他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.97,0:19:06.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,扶摇留下护你们周全
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.68,0:19:07.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.31,0:19:08.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.35,0:19:10.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只要阿昭肯走
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.86,0:19:11.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可以
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.19,0:19:13.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,其实半月古城很好找
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.23,0:19:15.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,顺着这个方向下去就能到
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.49,0:19:21.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,阿昭
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.95,0:19:22.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,靠你了 阿昭
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.74,0:19:23.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是啊 拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.95,0:19:24.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那我们就出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.48,0:19:54.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你怀疑这个阿昭
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.82,0:19:56.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可能是我多心了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.74,0:19:58.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,反正把他带出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.28,0:19:59.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,盯着就好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.04,0:20:09.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他们离开多久了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.54,0:20:11.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,阿昭说半月国不远
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.21,0:20:12.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,应该快到了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.42,0:20:15.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我怕郑伯撑不到他们回来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.63,0:20:16.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.88,0:20:18.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我想解手
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.84,0:20:19.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也想
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.42,0:20:20.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还有我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.55,0:20:25.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.94,0:20:36.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,到了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.80,0:21:03.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这就是半月国了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.68,0:21:05.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,墙是挺高
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.10,0:21:07.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但看起来还没一座城大
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.26,0:21:09.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,打这国
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.43,0:21:10.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,岂不是只要几天
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.68,0:21:13.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可别小瞧这沙漠小国
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.94,0:21:15.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,虽说不过万人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.23,0:21:16.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可全民皆兵
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.31,0:21:17.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,勇猛好斗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.52,0:21:18.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所以特别难打
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.36,0:21:21.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,道长知道得不少
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.53,0:21:23.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我只是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.36,0:21:23.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.74,0:21:25.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.58,0:21:35.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么一转眼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.87,0:21:37.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那些人就不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.75,0:21:39.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,难道还要我一个一个找出来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.05,0:21:43.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是半月国师
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.01,0:21:45.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,叫你那些朋友帮你找
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.43,0:21:46.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我不
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.51,0:21:48.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我就爱叫你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.01,0:21:49.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,开心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.22,0:21:52.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有什么值得开心的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.85,0:21:53.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.69,0:21:55.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.64,0:21:56.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要先出手吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.44,0:21:58.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,等她们离开吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.81,0:21:59.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,时间宝贵
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.94,0:22:01.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,找善月草要紧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.78,0:22:02.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,现在交手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.28,0:22:05.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,万一她把那群传说中的半月士兵给叫来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.95,0:22:06.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.95,0:22:12.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.04,0:22:13.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么了
